# Class map

`docs/class-map.md` is the project diagram of classes, interfaces, and their fields.

When a change adds, removes, or renames a class, interface, or field, update that file in the same change. Keep the mermaid diagrams and the ownership arrows in sync with the source. Do not list methods.
